language design-core version 0.6.
container SdpToolHost.
unit ContextFacade.
unit RoutineCoordinator.
unit RunRepository.
unit CheckedResultPublisher.
database OperationalRunStore.
interface CanonicalProjectHistoryLibrary.
capability BoundedGovernedWork.
feature BoundedRunControl.
usecase RecoverBoundedWork.
actor ProjectOwner.
mode RoutineHandling.
activity ExistingRunFoundation.
functionality ResolveExistingWork.
functionality CheckBoundedRunTransition.
functionality PersistRunReceipt.
functionality PublishBoundedResult.
SdpToolHost contains ContextFacade.
SdpToolHost contains RoutineCoordinator.
SdpToolHost contains RunRepository.
SdpToolHost contains CheckedResultPublisher.
SdpToolHost provides BoundedGovernedWork.
RunRepository owns OperationalRunStore.
CheckedResultPublisher consumes CanonicalProjectHistoryLibrary.
ProjectOwner pursues RecoverBoundedWork.
BoundedRunControl supports RecoverBoundedWork.
ExistingRunFoundation delivers BoundedRunControl.
ExistingRunFoundation has implementation-status = implemented.
ContextFacade owns ResolveExistingWork.
ResolveExistingWork allocated-to SdpToolHost in mode RoutineHandling.
ResolveExistingWork contributes-to BoundedRunControl.
ResolveExistingWork realizes BoundedGovernedWork.
ExistingRunFoundation addresses ResolveExistingWork.
RoutineCoordinator owns CheckBoundedRunTransition.
CheckBoundedRunTransition allocated-to SdpToolHost in mode RoutineHandling.
CheckBoundedRunTransition contributes-to BoundedRunControl.
CheckBoundedRunTransition realizes BoundedGovernedWork.
ExistingRunFoundation addresses CheckBoundedRunTransition.
RunRepository owns PersistRunReceipt.
PersistRunReceipt allocated-to SdpToolHost in mode RoutineHandling.
PersistRunReceipt contributes-to BoundedRunControl.
PersistRunReceipt realizes BoundedGovernedWork.
ExistingRunFoundation addresses PersistRunReceipt.
CheckedResultPublisher owns PublishBoundedResult.
PublishBoundedResult allocated-to SdpToolHost in mode RoutineHandling.
PublishBoundedResult contributes-to BoundedRunControl.
PublishBoundedResult realizes BoundedGovernedWork.
ExistingRunFoundation addresses PublishBoundedResult.
